/-!
# The literal degree-518 row orbit spans

The 517 appended-generator edges identify the saved rows with the orbit of v.
The 518 checked inverse rows give R * Ri = 1; square-matrix inverse symmetry
then proves that these orbit rows span. This discharges exactly the row-span
premise of `matrixAlgebraFull_of_rank_one_and_spans`.

Source: R. A. Wilson et al., ATLAS HSG1-f2r518B0 and
`Binary/source/density518.json`. See `Rows/source/README.md` for reproduction.
-/

